        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Embroidered cushion cover, dark brown linen ground, solidly embroidered with several shades of blue, green, red, yellow, and a little cream white, brown, and black wool which has almost entirely rotted away, background of design blue, a plant with scrolling branches and leaves and flowers grows from a vase in lower middle, an armorial shield in each corner, arms not identified, edges piped with yellow and red woolen cloth, back of cover brown linen, faded, torn, repaired."@en ;
